      86.18,
      211.7,
      509.21,
      223.7
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR SEA AREAS AROUND THE ISLAND DURING NEXT 24 HOURS",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.42,
      228.62,
      410.06,
      241.1
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 20 September 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      261.5,
      556.51,
      290.33
    ],
    "text": "A low pressure area has formed over the Andaman sea in the Bay of Bengal which is likely to get intensified in next few days.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      294.11,
      556.57,
      366.41
    ],
    "text": "Due to its influence, wind speeds over the Bay of Bengal will increase. Navel and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea areas are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards. Condition of Rain:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      378.05,
      564.99,
      423.77
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Hambanthota via Puttalam, Colombo and Galle. Showers or thundershowers may occur at several places in the other sea areas during the evening or night.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      435.41,
      376.1,
      464.45
    ],
    "text": "Winds: Winds will be South-westerly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      467.5,
      563.33,
      587.11
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to (50-60) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota. Wind speed can increase up to 50 kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Kankasanthurai via Mannar. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coast extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough at times. The sea areas off the coasts extending from Puttalam to Kankasanthurai via Mannar will be fairly rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      589.9,
      558.99,
      640.51
    ],
    "text": "Temporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers. The wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 2.5) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Matara.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  }
